<title>USA: 3Com sees Q3 below most analyst estimates.</title>
<headline>3Com sees Q3 below most analyst estimates.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CLARA, Calif. 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>3Com Corp Monday said it expects fiscal third-quarter revenues ending February 28 to be in a range of $770-$810 million, with per-share earnings in the mid 40 cents to low 50 cents range, below most analysts' estimates.</p>
<p>The company reported revenues of $606 million in the year-ago period and share earnings of $0.42 a year ago.</p>
<p>3Com expects to release final results for the third fiscal quarter on March 20.  </p>
<p>The First Call consensus for the current quarter is $0.60 a share.</p>
</text>
